From eae3b9386c88ec539cc042f7af6af07ec07c0e2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefane Fermigier <sf@abilian.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:53:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(word): positional tabs are read, laid out and written
 back

A w:ptab is a run item of its own, CRunPTab, a tab to the left edge,
the centre or the right edge of the area between the margins or the
indents, read from and written to run item 35 and the change log. After
ElixirOffice 0.7.3 (leag1234/sdkjs 8f74f43).
---
